  "id": "orap",
  "term": "Orap",
  "definition": "Orap is the brand name for pimozide, a drug with antipsychotic effects. It works mainly by blocking dopamine type 2 receptors in the central nervous system, which lowers dopamine signaling and can reduce motor and vocal tics and delusions of parasitosis.",
